        "number": "KB0010042",
        "short_description": "VPN to the Lyon site drops: check the MTU on the Lyon concentrator",
        "text": "Symptom: VPN tunnels of the Lyon site drop and come back on their own; large transfers and video calls fail first. Cause: packets over 1400 bytes are fragmented between the site and its concentrator, vpn-lyon-01. Fix: set the MTU to 1400 on the Lyon concentrator, as CHG0003311 did. A firmware upgrade of the concentrator resets the MTU to 1500: check it after each upgrade.",
